---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sidekik"
  description="Privacy policy of Sidekik GmbH."
  lang="en"
  path="/privacy-policy"
>
  <article class="legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="status">Status: Aug 13, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      Protecting your data is important to us. In this privacy policy, we explain what
      information we collect, how we use it, and what rights you have regarding your data.
      Please also read our Terms of Use, as they form the basis for using our services.
    </p>
    <p>The data controller is:</p>
    <p>
      Sidekik GmbH<br />
      Sitz: Münster<br />
      Entgasse 36i,<br />
      6232 Münster,<br />
      Österreich
    </p>
    <p>
      Firmenbuchnummer: FN 670265i<br />
      Firmenbuchgericht: Landesgericht Innsbruck<br />
      MD: Bernhard Fercher<br />
      E-Mail: <a href="mailto:hi@sidekik.cloud">hi@sidekik.cloud</a>
    </p>

    <h2>2. What Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect the following personal data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account and Profile Data:</strong> Name, username, gender (optional), country of origin (optional), email address.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Interactions within the app, e.g., uploaded photos, participation in challenges, shared flights.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, operating system, browser or device type.</li>
      <li><strong>Uploaded Content:</strong> Photos and flight data that you voluntarily share.</li>
      <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> Used to improve the user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
    <p>We use the collected data for the following purposes:</p>

    <h3>Operating and Improving the Platform:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Providing core features, such as flight tracking, challenges, and community interactions.</li>
      <li>Analyzing usage data to improve user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Security:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Protecting against unauthorized access and misuse of the platform.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Communication:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Responding to support requests and notifying users about new features or changes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Sharing of Data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Internal Use:</strong> Your data is only processed by our internal team.</li>
      <li><strong>External Providers:</strong> We use Google Analytics (website analytics) and Amplitude (app metrics), where data is processed in anonymized form.</li>
      <li><strong>No Data Sharing with Third Parties:</strong> We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties outside of the providers mentioned above.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All data is stored on servers within the EU.</p>

    <h2>5. How Long We Store Your Data</h2>
    <p>
      We store your data for as long as you use the platform. After account deletion, your data
      will be retained for a maximum of 90 days for technical reasons and then permanently
      deleted.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>As a user, you have the following rights under the GDPR:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request a copy of the data we have stored about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Incorrect or incomplete data can be corrected.</li>
      <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request the complete deletion of your data.</li>
      <li><strong>Objection:</strong> You can object to the processing of your data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@sidekik.cloud">support@sidekik.cloud</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

    <h2>7. Security of Your Data</h2>
    <p>We use state-of-the-art technologies to protect your data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>End-to-end encryption during data transmission.</li>
      <li>Access to data only by authorized personnel.</li>
      <li>Regular security audits and updates.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>8. Use of Cookies and Tracking Tools</h2>
    <p>
      Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to improve user experience. You can
      adjust your cookie settings at any time.
    </p>
    <p>Tools Used:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Website analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Amplitude:</strong> In-app usage analysis.</li>
      <li><strong>PostHog:</strong> In-app usage analysis.</li>
      <li><strong>OneSignal:</strong> Senden von Push Notifications und Newsletter</li>
      <li><strong>RevenueCat:</strong> Managen von Subscriptions</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      Any changes to this privacy policy will be communicated to you via email. The current
      version is always available on our website.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions or concerns about how we process your data, please contact us
      at: <a href="mailto:support@sidekik.cloud">support@sidekik.cloud</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 720px; margin: 2rem auto 4rem; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .legal h3 { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .status { color: var(--color-muted); }
</style>
